WEBVTT

00:03.260 --> 00:06.600
A remedy that attracts women when 
used to wash one's armpit.

00:06.600 --> 00:09.630
A remedy that relieves itching when 
applied to the soles of the feet.

00:10.150 --> 00:13.360
A remedy that you burn to repel insects.

00:13.360 --> 00:15.070
Yep, they're all here.

00:15.910 --> 00:18.610
I'll take good care of your merchandise.

00:19.340 --> 00:24.150
Oh, by the way, this remedy has been 
selling well since you changed the packaging.

00:24.150 --> 00:24.910
Okay.

00:24.910 --> 00:28.700
I'm keeping a close eye on the 
sales, so don't you worry.

00:28.700 --> 00:31.250
I'm calling it "Old Man Banking."

00:31.240 --> 00:32.980
You're still saying that?

00:32.980 --> 00:35.070
And what a shady name.

00:35.070 --> 00:36.480
You're definitely skimming off the top.

00:36.480 --> 00:39.230
I really want you to trust me on that.

00:39.230 --> 00:42.710
If it's something you need,
I'll see to it that you get it,

00:42.710 --> 00:44.420
be it money, remedy, or anything at all.

00:54.310 --> 00:56.250
<i>There's no deep meaning behind it.</i>

00:56.650 --> 00:59.790
<i>I just want a replacement, because 
the one I'm wearing is getting old.</i>

00:59.790 --> 01:00.700
<i>No reason behind it.</i>

01:01.040 --> 01:02.400
Come to think of it...

01:03.170 --> 01:05.360
Did you bring any robes with you?

01:05.360 --> 01:07.130
It can be anything, really.

01:07.980 --> 01:10.080
I didn't bring them today.

01:10.530 --> 01:11.700
Oh, all right.

01:12.880 --> 01:14.600
But you know!

01:15.590 --> 01:17.440
I'll bring them right away!

01:17.440 --> 01:19.760
And I mean immediately! With haste!

01:24.720 --> 01:27.400
<i>Is what we spoke about yesterday.</i>

01:29.610 --> 01:31.570
<i>And today...</i>

01:50.090 --> 01:55.130
<b>Hello, I Am a Witch</b>

01:50.090 --> 01:55.130
<b>and My Crush Wants Me to Make a Love Potion</b>

03:09.000 --> 03:13.460
Episode 2:
The Good Witch of the Lake

03:13.460 --> 03:16.770
This fabric is embroidered 
with beads used by the royals

03:16.770 --> 03:19.600
that depicts a flower which only 
blooms in that certain oasis.

03:20.080 --> 03:24.640
And this is the fur of a monster that only appears on the day of the midnight sun.

03:25.220 --> 03:26.060
Uh-huh.

03:26.060 --> 03:27.510
This fabric, too.

03:27.510 --> 03:31.470
Yup. It's dyed with the sacred water
 from the snow nation, so it's vibrant.

03:31.470 --> 03:33.840
And the color doesn't fade, 
no matter how how much you wash it.

03:32.960 --> 03:36.430
<i>I didn't think he'd bring 
so many the very next day.</i>

03:36.430 --> 03:40.860
Come now! What shall I get for you, 
Rose, the "Witch of the Lake"?

03:42.070 --> 03:45.530
By the way, my favorite would
probably be this lavender one.

03:45.530 --> 03:47.690
Yup, it'd look great on you!

03:48.490 --> 03:51.700
Though truthfully, I really want you 
to wear a rose pink one, but...

03:51.700 --> 03:53.160
Absolutely not!

03:53.160 --> 03:56.190
Yeah, thought so. I figured as much.

03:56.190 --> 03:58.120
That's exactly what I'm talking about, Rose.

03:58.480 --> 04:00.710
<i>Th-This guy.</i>

04:00.710 --> 04:03.690
<i>Shall I jam the remedy that makes even
 black glowing monsters flip over</i>

04:03.690 --> 04:06.020
<i>when placed in the corner
of a house down his throat?</i>

04:06.020 --> 04:09.620
<i>No, it might be better just to use </i>that<i>...</i>

04:10.280 --> 04:13.020
<i>Oh, no, no. I suppose that 
would be going too far.</i>

04:14.160 --> 04:17.230
Why did you only bring 
these fancy colored ones?

04:17.230 --> 04:18.940
You ask why but...

04:19.510 --> 04:21.770
<i>The</i> Rose, who only wore 
hand-me-downs from her mother,

04:21.770 --> 04:24.990
claiming they were still wearable, and 
showed no interest in beautifying herself!

04:24.990 --> 04:27.370
And even when you took over 
the "Witch of the Lake" title,

04:27.370 --> 04:30.870
I strongly suggested you get
something nice tailored, and you didn't!

04:30.870 --> 04:32.580
That's who we're talking about here!

04:33.240 --> 04:34.790
But now, you're interested!

04:35.180 --> 04:38.500
How can I <i>not</i> go all out?

04:39.740 --> 04:42.750
Come now, you don't have to 
worry about the amount.

04:42.750 --> 04:46.500
It's plenty late, but let me give 
this to you as a celebration gift.

04:47.130 --> 04:50.840
So, pick out one outfit here and, 
bam, make it an adorable one.

04:50.840 --> 04:52.650
What do you mean "an adorable one"?

04:53.160 --> 04:58.100
<i>I must be frozen in time 
at ten years old to Tien.</i>

04:58.640 --> 05:01.090
<i>We first met behind my 
grandmother's skirt.</i>

05:01.460 --> 05:05.410
<i>Before that, Tien's father used to come 
to peddle business and I met Tien</i>

05:05.410 --> 05:07.670
<i>when he decided to take over.</i>

05:08.840 --> 05:12.860
<i>When my grandmother passed away, 
too, if it weren't for the Côngs,</i>

05:12.860 --> 05:15.490
<i>I might not have been able 
to give her a burial.</i>

05:15.810 --> 05:18.350
<i>They've both been very good to me.</i>

05:21.560 --> 05:26.480
<i>That's why when he says stuff like that, 
it's hard for me to say anything back.</i>

05:27.210 --> 05:29.180
Come now, which one will it be?

05:29.500 --> 05:32.890
I don't know about how adorable or 
fashionable something is, but...

05:32.890 --> 05:37.100
I can tell when something is impossible 
for me to wear while brewing my remedies.

05:37.340 --> 05:40.690
Just the fact that you know that 
much shows you've improved.

05:40.690 --> 05:42.250
When it came to you and clothing,

05:42.250 --> 05:44.820
you used to dirty whatever you 
wore without a second thought.

05:44.820 --> 05:47.040
Don't say it like I've no common sense!

05:47.040 --> 05:48.570
I just wasn't interested!

05:48.570 --> 05:51.240
Don't say it like you've got common sense.

05:51.240 --> 05:55.030
Still, I'm happy to see that you've 
taken some interest in it.

05:55.030 --> 05:58.380
It's not like it's not
 that sort of thing...

05:59.250 --> 06:00.000
Oh.

06:01.750 --> 06:03.890
What? You're curious about that one?

06:03.890 --> 06:05.210
Let's try holding it up against you.

06:04.710 --> 06:05.420
Stop it.

06:06.530 --> 06:08.140
Tien, please stop.

06:10.350 --> 06:13.590
<i>This is practically the same as 
telling him I'm curious about it!</i>

06:14.590 --> 06:16.450
<i>But, I can't.</i>

06:16.450 --> 06:18.920
<i>I'm sure if I had a robe 
tailored out of this,</i>

06:18.920 --> 06:22.380
<i>it'd probably feel like I'm 
being wrapped in his cloak.</i>

06:23.590 --> 06:25.600
<i>I might start getting the wrong idea.</i>

06:25.600 --> 06:28.480
<i>I might start fantasizing 
about such a dream, and...</i>

06:31.410 --> 06:33.070
Here, look at this.

06:33.070 --> 06:34.910
This is the color that suits you.

06:36.360 --> 06:39.770
This and this fabric 
may look a bit plain,

06:39.770 --> 06:43.080
but it's purposely woven this way 
to make it look like a flower.

06:43.450 --> 06:45.540
You'll see it best when
 you're in the sunlight.

06:45.910 --> 06:49.520
I mostly don't go out into the sunlight, 
so something safe and simple is fine.

06:49.910 --> 06:51.460
Then this color would be good.

06:51.820 --> 06:55.690
It's called viridian blue, and it's 
the color of the forest you love.

06:56.520 --> 06:59.080
<i>The color of the forest 
reflected in the lake.</i>

06:59.390 --> 07:00.830
Let's go with this one!

07:00.830 --> 07:03.370
Silk and gold threads were 
woven into it when it was made,

07:03.370 --> 07:06.730
so when lamplight hits it,
it looks exceptionally beautiful.

07:07.020 --> 07:10.420
It's not like I want to show anyone 
how beautiful it is or anything.

07:10.420 --> 07:15.700
See, even if you don't, I'm obligated
 to explain my products, all right?

07:19.710 --> 07:22.480
Since we're at it, how about 
some lip balm and blush, too?

07:22.480 --> 07:23.920
It'll bring out your complexion.

07:23.920 --> 07:27.120
If it's complexion, just slapping 
my cheeks is good enough.

07:27.120 --> 07:29.610
I can't just stand by and 
watch my adorable witch

07:29.610 --> 07:32.360
continue to slap her 
own cheeks like that.

07:32.360 --> 07:36.500
You have fair skin, so a cool-toned pink 
color would definitely suit you well.

07:36.500 --> 07:38.980
Even if I did buy it, when would I...

07:39.280 --> 07:41.100
I don't want the money.

07:41.100 --> 07:43.430
I want to buy it for you, Rose.

07:45.430 --> 07:47.450
Now, which one will it be?

07:47.450 --> 07:50.080
This cameo over here is one 
everyone in the royal capital

07:49.250 --> 07:50.960
<i>It's no use trying to stop him.</i>

07:50.080 --> 07:51.970
knows of and is the cutting 
edge of fashion...

07:50.960 --> 07:52.520
<i>I'll go back to work.</i>

08:44.420 --> 08:49.380
<i>It's far too obvious if I suddenly 
start wearing a brand-new robe.</i>

09:09.710 --> 09:10.850
All right.

09:19.420 --> 09:23.410
<i>Ten, nine, eight, seven...</i>

09:25.380 --> 09:28.840
<i>Four, three, two.</i>

09:33.960 --> 09:38.420
Welcome. Have you managed to acquire 
the things I've asked for?

09:38.630 --> 09:39.640
Yeah.

09:52.720 --> 09:54.020
Please check it.

10:03.610 --> 10:06.730
Um, are you tired?

10:06.730 --> 10:10.230
I have a remedy that 
instantly relieves fatigue.

10:10.230 --> 10:11.570
I've no need for it.

10:11.940 --> 10:14.110
<i>That look of skepticism on his face.</i>

10:14.110 --> 10:16.510
<i>Does he not believe 
in a witch's secret remedies?</i>

10:19.000 --> 10:21.610
<i>Then why would he 
ask for a love potion?</i>

10:21.610 --> 10:27.230
<i>As if I haven't already mulled over 
the reasons why he'd want a love potion.</i>

10:29.520 --> 10:32.120
<i>I was right. I'm glad I didn't 
put on the lip balm.</i>

10:43.660 --> 10:44.660
What's going on?

10:46.540 --> 10:48.830
Can't you tidy up a bit?

10:51.290 --> 10:55.930
Unfortunately, I do not have any magic 
that automatically tidies up a room.

10:56.410 --> 10:58.250
You can just use your 
two hands, can't you?

10:59.470 --> 11:04.050
<i>These two hands may be able to cast 
magic, but they cannot tidy up.</i>

11:04.050 --> 11:05.600
<i>Because I'm a witch after all.</i>

11:06.100 --> 11:08.020
<i>Because... I'm a witch after all.</i>

11:09.140 --> 11:11.230
Hm? What is this?

11:11.230 --> 11:14.890
Huh?! Oh, I would say that's 
lettuce from a few days ago.

11:16.780 --> 11:20.370
Lady Witch, you always seem to 
be eating nothing but lettuce.

11:20.370 --> 11:21.630
Is it some sort of preference you have?

11:21.630 --> 11:25.660
No. It's just that lettuce is the only 
vegetable planted in the garden patch.

11:25.660 --> 11:27.950
After all, you can even eat 
it without cooking it.

11:28.790 --> 11:29.710
Huh?

11:31.850 --> 11:33.000
Huh?

11:33.320 --> 11:34.950
<i>He said it twice.</i>

11:35.260 --> 11:37.510
Have you been only eating lettuce?

11:37.510 --> 11:41.100
I do eat other things whenever 
I go into town, but...

11:41.100 --> 11:42.920
Yeah, basically.

11:58.760 --> 12:01.780
A chicken's leg has more meat than this.

12:01.780 --> 12:03.480
That's ridiculous.

12:06.320 --> 12:08.360
<i>Lord Harij is looking at me.</i>

12:08.360 --> 12:10.690
<i>He's so close. His eyelashes are 
long. His face is handsome.</i>

12:10.690 --> 12:13.830
<i>To think I'm able to bask before an 
armament of a face at point-blank range...</i>

12:17.630 --> 12:18.900
My apologies.

12:18.900 --> 12:19.840
It's fine.

12:23.510 --> 12:26.700
For now, I will proceed with dispensing 
the ingredients I have received.

12:26.700 --> 12:28.760
Please come back again in a month.

12:30.020 --> 12:31.980
It's going to take a 
long time again, huh?

12:32.020 --> 12:35.980
<b>Hello, I Am a Witch and
My Crush Wants Me to
Make a Love Potion</b>

12:35.980 --> 12:38.990
<b>and My Crush Wants Me to Make a Love Potion</b>

12:35.980 --> 12:38.990
<b>Hello, I am a Witch</b>

12:46.470 --> 12:48.850
It really feels like summer now.

12:49.700 --> 12:54.190
<i>Lately, I've started to bathe 
more often, even if I find it a hassle.</i>

12:59.900 --> 13:02.170
It must be because it's gotten so hot.

13:02.170 --> 13:04.080
Not that there's a reason behind it.

13:06.880 --> 13:09.000
One month, huh...

13:09.300 --> 13:14.410
<i>A month's span is the actual time 
required to process the materials.</i>

13:14.980 --> 13:18.730
<i>Until then, Lord Harij 
will not be coming here.</i>

13:20.300 --> 13:24.660
And here I thought I was good 
at hiding my emotions, too.

13:24.930 --> 13:27.120
<i>I've lived my whole life 
keeping it hidden.</i>

13:27.120 --> 13:28.900
<i>Because I am a witch.</i>

13:29.400 --> 13:32.650
<i>There is a reason why only witches 
can create remedies with potency</i>

13:32.650 --> 13:35.140
<i>far beyond what humans are 
capable of producing.</i>

13:35.910 --> 13:40.690
<i>It's because a witch who uses a lie known 
as magic, cannot use any other kind of lie.</i>

13:41.260 --> 13:44.120
<i>The reason we're unsociable and ominous</i>

13:44.120 --> 13:46.880
<i>is to keep others from realizing 
that we cannot tell a lie.</i>

13:47.420 --> 13:50.960
<i>It's all to keep others at a distance.</i>

13:51.510 --> 13:57.000
<i>Even though we cannot lie, we can still 
hide the truth or steer conversation away.</i>

13:57.450 --> 14:00.850
<i>Until now, that's how I've managed 
to survive all on my own.</i>

14:01.620 --> 14:06.570
And I will continue to live on like 
this forever, all on my own.

14:14.780 --> 14:15.620
Okay!

14:15.620 --> 14:18.070
The weather is nice, so 
I'll wash my chemise, too!

14:36.970 --> 14:38.360
Is it a deer?

14:38.360 --> 14:40.350
Is it that smug-faced deer again?

14:38.480 --> 14:40.350
<b>Smug</b>

14:41.610 --> 14:42.460
Huh?

14:54.420 --> 14:55.770
M-My apologies!

15:06.160 --> 15:08.580
<i>Did he see me? He saw me.
He saw me!</i>

15:08.800 --> 15:13.470
<i>To think Lord Harij, of all people, 
would see me with my pale skinned,</i>

15:13.470 --> 15:16.060
<i>sloppy figure that's not even 
constrained by a corset!</i>

15:16.060 --> 15:18.010
<i>More like, why is he here?!</i>

15:18.010 --> 15:21.110
<i>A month hasn't even passed yet,
and it's the middle of the day!</i>

15:23.890 --> 15:26.010
For now, let me at least don a robe.

15:39.500 --> 15:41.220
Thank you for waiting.

15:41.220 --> 15:42.750
Please come this way.

15:51.460 --> 15:53.670
I sincerely apologize for 
what happened earlier.

15:53.670 --> 15:56.220
No, it is I who must apologize.

15:56.220 --> 15:59.130
I never imagined you'd
be here right now, Lord Harij.

16:01.010 --> 16:03.440
You know who I am?

16:04.900 --> 16:06.230
<i>Shoot!</i>

16:06.230 --> 16:08.600
<i>Lord Harij has never once 
mentioned his name.</i>

16:10.630 --> 16:12.280
You know, don't you?

16:12.940 --> 16:15.550
Yes. Yes, I do.

16:15.550 --> 16:16.730
Since when?

16:18.050 --> 16:20.710
<i>I can't come up with the right 
words to dodge the question.</i>

16:21.250 --> 16:22.800
I'll have you answer me.

16:23.900 --> 16:25.400
Four years ago.

16:25.400 --> 16:27.010
That long ago?

16:29.970 --> 16:32.630
Um, please have mercy on me!

16:32.630 --> 16:35.780
I shall never disclose my dear 
client's information to anyone!

16:35.780 --> 16:39.130
R-Right now, I'm in a 
very abnormal situation!

16:39.130 --> 16:40.870
Something is very wrong with me!

16:40.870 --> 16:42.120
If I were asked anything more...

16:42.120 --> 16:42.960
What?

16:43.630 --> 16:47.860
<i>Ah, I'm running out of
oxygen. My head's spinning.</i>

16:48.510 --> 16:49.570
What do you mean by that?

16:50.960 --> 16:54.540
<i>Lord Harij is looking at me.
He's staring at me.</i>

16:55.700 --> 16:57.430
W-Witches...

16:57.430 --> 17:01.910
In exchange for using magic, 
witches cannot tell lies!

17:02.230 --> 17:04.110
Cannot tell lies?

17:04.370 --> 17:05.580
<i>It's over.</i>

17:05.870 --> 17:07.900
<i>I even revealed the witch's secret,</i>

17:07.900 --> 17:10.550
<i>which is the one thing we must 
never disclose to anyone.</i>

17:11.080 --> 17:12.400
What do you—

17:12.400 --> 17:14.850
Please! I'm really sorry!

17:14.850 --> 17:16.510
I-I cannot say more...

17:18.460 --> 17:22.010
Er, I understand that you have 
your own reasons, Lady Witch.

17:22.460 --> 17:26.220
However, as a knight, I have 
things I must ask as well.

17:26.520 --> 17:31.550
<i>If he continues to question me like this, 
I'll end up telling Lord Harij everything.</i>

17:31.550 --> 17:35.040
About knowing me from four years ago...

17:35.320 --> 17:38.980
<i>There's nothing that can be done now 
that he knows of the witch's weakness.</i>

17:39.740 --> 17:43.660
<i>But what if he finds out 
about my feelings for him?</i>

17:44.250 --> 17:47.220
<i>What if he were to find out 
about how a wretched, weak,</i>

17:47.220 --> 17:51.930
<i>despicable witch has fallen in love with 
a beautiful, strong, noble man like him?</i>

17:52.460 --> 17:54.870
If that's the case, I'd rather die.

17:55.710 --> 17:56.340
Hey!

17:58.280 --> 18:01.380
<i>It was so obvious that I had 
forgotten all about it.</i>

18:01.760 --> 18:04.340
<i>That sort of remedy is my specialty.</i>

18:06.260 --> 18:08.720
<i>I am a witch after all.</i>

18:10.160 --> 18:11.690
What are you doing?!

18:18.820 --> 18:21.820
I-It's not that I'm a nymphomaniac! 
I'm a witch, and...

18:21.820 --> 18:22.680
That's right!

18:22.680 --> 18:25.650
Most of my earnings go toward ingredients
 for the next batch of remedies,

18:25.650 --> 18:28.730
and since I'm far too indifferent about 
my appearance, I don't have spare clothes—

18:27.870 --> 18:30.030
I understand. Hold on, I apologize.

18:30.030 --> 18:31.330
Truly.

18:31.330 --> 18:34.670
I clearly understand that you're deeply 
shaken by all this, Lady Witch.

18:49.100 --> 18:50.340
Pardon me.

18:53.490 --> 18:55.310
U-Um...

18:55.580 --> 19:00.250
I offer my apologies for having exposed a 
secret that would drive you to choose death.

19:00.560 --> 19:04.480
Of course, I shall keep what
 happened earlier to myself.

19:04.480 --> 19:06.500
I shall never speak a 
word of it to anyone.

19:06.500 --> 19:07.650
As a knight, I swear it.

19:07.900 --> 19:09.050
I pray you believe me.

19:12.420 --> 19:14.770
How did you know it was poison?

19:14.770 --> 19:17.420
I didn't know what kind of remedy it was,

19:17.420 --> 19:19.430
but I remembered seeing 
that look in your eyes.

19:19.630 --> 19:23.630
People who feel backed into a corner 
often have that look on their faces.

19:24.030 --> 19:26.610
So, I'm glad I made it in time.

19:27.000 --> 19:29.370
<i>Oh, that's right.</i>

19:29.370 --> 19:31.760
<i>This is the kind of 
person Lord Harij is.</i>

19:32.180 --> 19:36.550
<i>A kind person who cares even 
about the life of a mere witch.</i>

19:41.860 --> 19:43.560
Have you calmed down a bit?

19:44.990 --> 19:46.660
I'm glad then.

19:46.660 --> 19:49.840
I almost ended up having to 
eat all of this by myself.

19:52.910 --> 19:54.130
Bread.

19:54.130 --> 19:56.720
You hadn't been eating anything decent,

19:56.720 --> 19:58.080
having nothing but lettuce.

19:58.530 --> 20:00.680
Anyway, you're...

20:00.680 --> 20:05.310
Uh, a young lady, so you need 
to put on a little more weight.

20:05.310 --> 20:07.090
<i>He worried about me.</i>

20:05.850 --> 20:07.880
Anyway, you're dealing with remedies.

20:07.610 --> 20:10.760
<i>Even if it's but for a moment, 
he thought about me.</i>

20:07.880 --> 20:10.750
You face danger more than 
the average person...

20:10.760 --> 20:14.200
<i>Oh, this is what joy is.</i>

20:10.770 --> 20:14.030
and if you fall ill with that
meatless body, you won't survive.

20:14.970 --> 20:16.540
It looks delicious.

20:16.540 --> 20:17.730
Thank you.

20:17.730 --> 20:18.430
Wait!

20:18.430 --> 20:20.120
Do you intend on eating it there?

20:20.120 --> 20:22.270
Huh? I was?

20:22.270 --> 20:25.170
First, clear off this table.

20:29.100 --> 20:31.650
Heh, this is why nobles are so—

20:31.650 --> 20:33.130
I can hear you, you know.

20:33.130 --> 20:34.670
I'm making sure you hear it.

20:45.660 --> 20:47.100
<i>So nitpicky.</i>

20:47.100 --> 20:48.670
<i>What is he? A mother-in-law?</i>

20:50.220 --> 20:51.680
Well, I suppose that'll do.

20:52.130 --> 20:53.860
I'm glad to hear that.

20:57.380 --> 20:59.930
<i>Wh-What? Is it still dirty somewhere?</i>

20:59.930 --> 21:01.280
<i>My face? Is it my face?</i>

21:01.280 --> 21:03.200
<i>There's nothing I can 
really do about that!</i>

21:03.580 --> 21:04.740
Aren't you going to sit down?

21:04.740 --> 21:06.690
R-Right.

21:17.390 --> 21:19.080
<i>It's not an illusion.</i>

21:19.450 --> 21:22.460
<i>Lord Harij is sitting 
right in front of me.</i>

21:22.460 --> 21:24.460
<i>I never imagined a day 
like this would come.</i>

21:28.770 --> 21:29.780
What is it?

21:30.430 --> 21:33.590
Oh, no. I just found it unusual.

21:33.590 --> 21:35.140
Is that butter?

21:35.140 --> 21:37.090
Apparently, it's apple butter.

21:37.090 --> 21:38.860
I heard it tastes delicious 
spread on bread.

21:38.860 --> 21:42.310
Oh, I like apples,
so that makes me happy.

21:42.310 --> 21:44.310
I see. Here.

21:44.310 --> 21:45.780
Thank you.

21:51.040 --> 21:53.190
<i>A sweet apple scent.</i>

22:10.890 --> 22:17.440
